ZH 这是新系统的目标设计，每个模块都有 PRD；当前实现差距见 docs/poc/pipeline-plan.md。系统做的事，就是维护一个观点库：建观点、更新观点、到期关掉观点。上游把已经分好类的信息推进来；分发检查后编上顺序号，交给抽取。抽取用资深对冲基金分析师的视角，对着这些对象已有的观点，把每条信息整份读完，交出带出处的证据和候选观点，同时确定候选观点的研究归属（D149）。观点库保留归属；观点和证据的身份仍先搜、再由模型比：候选观点是归入已有的、接续上一期、开新的，还是不开；证据是重复、替代还是新证据。一条观点是一个问题、一把梯子和一个到期日，证据把它的状态往两头推；观点之间用依赖连起来，同一样东西一期接一期。记录只加不改。每次比对都记下来，挑一部分由人标注，以后训练一个更快的小模型接手。到期和定时的事由 Pull 模式做；查不到的放进人工复核池。除最终判定和 Pull 模式（旧稿，以后一起重做），各模块都已冻结；改动都先记一条决定，记在 docs/DECISIONS.md。和旧系统的区别：旧系统按日期主动拉数据、一批一批处理，还把财报拆成一大堆数；新系统信息来了就处理，从观点出发。
EN This is the target design; every module has a PRD. Implementation gaps are in docs/poc/pipeline-plan.md. The system maintains a thesis library: create theses, update their judgement and close them when due. Upstream supplies classified items. Dispatch validates them, assigns sequence numbers and sends them to extraction. Extraction reads each whole item as a senior hedge-fund analyst, alongside existing theses, and returns sourced evidence, candidate theses and their research-group associations (D149). The library preserves those associations. Identity remains a search-then-match decision: merge a candidate, continue a previous period, open it or skip it; repeat, replace or add evidence. Each thesis has a question, ladder and due date. Evidence moves its state; dependencies connect conclusions and succession connects periods. Records are append-only. Matching records support human labelling and a future smaller model. Pull mode owns schedules and due dates; unresolved items go to human review. All modules except final verdict and pull mode are frozen; changes require a decision in docs/DECISIONS.md. The old system pulled dated batches and split reports into many numbers. The new system processes incoming items from the needs of a thesis.
