69 nodes.pull.purpose @170
ZH 和信息流的方向相反：信息流来一条处理一条，从不看日历，也不管时间；按时间做的事都在这里。每天结束时、或按定时任务的间隔跑一次，主动把观点整体过一遍、更新。到期的观点，状态停在哪一格就定格，这条观点关掉，不另外定别的：让争论见分晓的那条信息照常作为证据进来、推状态；定格不另外等这些信息。比如 NVDA FY27 全年中国区收入那条，到期那天业绩发布进来，重判把状态推到“降 80% 及以上”；当天结束时 Pull 模式跑，状态定格在这一格，观点关掉，依赖它的读它关掉时的状态和理由。Pull 模式用的“现在”从外面传进来：上线用真实时间，测试用回放的时间。别的以后设计；旧稿（检验条件、兜底复核、合并拆分驱动）不再用。
EN The incoming stream processes one item at a time and never reads the calendar. Pull mode owns time-driven work: revisit and update theses at day-end or on a schedule. Freeze due theses at their current rung and close them without a separate result. Decisive information enters normally as evidence; freezing does not wait for it. For example, NVDA FY2027 China earnings move its thesis to “down at least 80%”; day-end pull freezes that state and closes it. Dependencies read its closing state and reasons. Pass “now” into pull mode: real time in production, replay time in tests. Other behaviour is deferred; earlier verification-condition, fallback-review and driver merge/split proposals no longer apply.
