EN Numeric theses name a year. Non-company quantities use calendar years: the publication year is this year and the following year is next year, each ending December 31. Company quantities use the fiscal year containing publication day and its successor. Never use the computer clock. For a given quantity, open at most one thesis for each of this year and next year; do not open later years. The due date is the quantity's publication date.
