304 INTAKE_STEPS.5.does @307
ZH 按归组规矩把抽取交来的归属连到最终观点，和本步一起保存；各对象自己的队列写，先写主题观点，再写对象观点；新观点和它的依赖箭头一起写；重复只给那一条多一个出处，这次新连上它的观点也连过去；替代按说的时间排（这句话是哪天说的），后说的算数，先说的标“被替代”，晚到的旧说法不加进来，只在处理记录里写一笔；被替代的证据还连着别的观点，新的那条也连过去；原始来源自己的修正版里找不到、也没被新句替代的原句，算删了，标“被替代”；比对时读到的东西在写进库之前变了，就把受影响的部分重新比对
EN Resolve extraction's group associations to final theses and save them in this step. Each subject has its own writing queue; write theme theses before asset theses. Save new theses with their dependency edges. A repeat adds a source reference and any new thesis link. For replacement, order by when the statement was made: later statements supersede earlier ones. A late-arriving older statement is logged, not inserted. Carry the old evidence's other thesis links to its replacement. An original-source revision that omits a statement without replacing it marks it replaced. If compared data changes before writing, repeat matching only for the affected part.
307 INTAKE_STEPS.6.does @308
ZH 读的东西变了的观点重判，只判开着的（关了的不判）：这一轮来了新证据、有证据被替代、新连上了一条已有的证据，或者它依赖的观点这一轮判完写了“变了”（刚建出来的、换成接续的下一期的，都算变了）。先判被依赖的观点，再判依赖它的，每条这一轮只判一次；连着的证据只多了出处，本身不触发重判；你自己的备忘录开的、还没连上证据的观点不判，状态写“还没判”；每条判完写明结论变不变，变了的，依赖它的接着判
EN Rejudge only open theses whose inputs changed: new/replaced/newly linked evidence, or a changed dependency conclusion, newly created awaited thesis or successor. Judge dependencies first and each thesis once per round. Extra source references alone do not trigger it. Memo-derived theses without evidence stay not yet judged. Each judgement declares whether its conclusion changed; changed conclusions propagate to dependants.
