EN Search method and ranking remain open: semantic, keyword or both. Test on stored information during implementation. Start with top 10 and adjust during experiments.
508 VIEWS_OPEN.1 @465
ZH 观点的颗粒度，也就是一条观点管多大的范围，还没定，要专门定。现在只定了：是已有观点的一部分，就归入那条；太大太杂的不开。要紧的那一块要单独成一条（NVDA 中国区收入很关键，不能归入总收入）；太粗的话，观点会全变成财务指标，这不行；要让模型清楚知道这样抽是错的。先做一次完整的调研：从对冲基金的角度看，一条观点到底长什么样，什么该合、什么该拆，每个对象盯几个问题（现实里每家公司只盯 2–3 个）。
EN Thesis granularity needs a separate decision. Current rules merge a part into its existing thesis and reject overly broad questions. A material segment deserves its own question: NVDA China revenue must not disappear into total revenue. Overly broad units reduce all theses to financial metrics, which is wrong. Research what hedge-fund theses look like, what to merge/split and how many questions to track per subject; the discussion assumes analysts focus on 2–3 per company.
509 VIEWS_OPEN.2 @466
