EN Earlier-draft example: July evidence points both ways, with NVIDIA's statement weakening the thesis and analyst A supporting it. They are different tiers and no factual weakening evidence has arrived, so no final verdict is triggered. In August, reported Commerce licence issuance meets the old falsification condition; the tightening-controls theme is judged falsified. Its dependent NVDA thesis is reviewed again and remains open because reported Chinese procurement restrictions prevent revenue recovery, with a new premise.
